 "notes": "Claude first pass, worst outcome in the pilot (pH 6.95). Baseline declines 140 -> ~75; from about -24 the trace is continuously unstable (75-145 swings, dead toco) and from ~-5.5 it is terminal bradycardia at 60-85. Toco is dead except clipped bursts -64..-51 and c34: every event without a readable contraction carries the UC flag. d6 prolonged (135s, nadir 57). Lates: d7, d8 (98s deep gradual troughs lagging real contractions), d13 (+43s). d10 left untyped+UC (gradual, no contraction context). Adds (both variable+UC): dm35 -16.9..-16.35 (60-75 trough missed between d20 and d21), dm36 -8.05..-7.35 (75-85 ~40s). Event delineation inside the -24..-15 chaos is somewhat arbitrary - reviewer should treat boundaries there loosely. d24 sits below even the collapsed baseline; after it the FHR stays 60-85 to delivery (baseline change, not annotated as decels).",
